This is a Halloween decoration, so it falls under festive articles in heading 9505. The relevant subheading is 9505.10 (Christmas articles) versus 9505.90 (other festive articles). Halloween items go in 9505.90, and the 9505.90.60 line covers other festive, carnival or entertainment articles, including Halloween decorations. A stuffed textile cat could be argued to be a toy, but the item is marketed exclusively as a Halloween decoration, so heading 9505 applies.

The statistical suffix is 9505.90.6000 for "Other" festive articles, which covers articles other than the specific lines for tricks/jokes or other specified categories.

